  <title id="vulcan-diagram-title">Vulcan architecture</title>
  <desc id="vulcan-diagram-desc">
    Clients and LangGraph advisor connect to a gateway and model-serving contract, which fans out to BentoML, Ray Serve, Triton, vLLM, and KServe. Training, GPU infra, and observability feed the same system.
